# Edge Function secrets are global to the shared Supabase project -> the VITRINA_ prefix is mandatory.
# Local: copy this file to supabase/functions/.env (git-ignored). Remote: `supabase secrets set`.
# Stripe secret key in test mode (sk_test_...). ONLY here, never in the client.
VITRINA_STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# Webhook signing secret (whsec_...). Local: printed by `stripe listen`. Remote: Dashboard -> Webhooks.
VITRINA_STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# The Supabase URL and keys are injected by the Edge Functions runtime; do not declare them here.
